# Microservices Architecture Rules

## 🔐 Service Boundaries (BẮT BUỘC)
- Mỗi service là 1 bounded context độc lập
- Database per service (KHÔNG share DB)
- KHÔNG foreign key giữa 2 services
- KHÔNG gọi trực tiếp DB của service khác
- Service gọi nhau qua API Gateway hoặc Kafka

## 📡 Communication Rules
| Loại | Khi nào |
|------|---------|
| REST qua Gateway | Query data cần ngay |
| Kafka event | Async, multiple consumers |
| WebSocket | Real-time push |
| ❌ Sync chain | KHÔNG BAO GIỜ (A → B → C → D) |

## 📋 Service Map
- **api-gateway** (Java) - port 8080
- **auth-service** (Java) - port 9000
- **content-service** (Java) - port 9001
- **exam-suite** (Node.js) - port 9005
- **analytics-service** (Java) - port 9004
- **notification-service** (Java) - port 9009
- **ai-suite** (Polyglot) - port 9100-9103
- **blockchain-suite** (Node.js) - port 9200

## 📦 Event Schema (BẮT BUỘC)
```json
{
  "eventId": "uuid-v7",
  "eventType": "UserRegistered",
  "eventVersion": "1.0",
  "occurredAt": "2026-08-12T10:00:00Z",
  "aggregateId": "user-123",
  "aggregateType": "User",
  "correlationId": "trace-id-xxx",
  "source": "auth-service",
  "payload": { ... }
}
```

## 📐 Event Naming (Past tense)
- `UserRegistered`, `UserLoggedIn`
- `CoursePublished`, `CourseEnrolled`
- `ExamStarted`, `ExamSubmitted`, `ExamGraded`
- `CertificateIssued`

## 🚫 ARCHITECTURAL VIOLATIONS (CẤM)
- ❌ Service gọi trực tiếp DB service khác
- ❌ Shared database
- ❌ Foreign key constraints giữa 2 databases
- ❌ Tight coupling giữa services
- ❌ Service gọi REST trực tiếp service khác (phải qua Gateway)
- ❌ Business logic trong Controller
- ❌ Framework dependencies trong Domain layer
- ❌ Shared entities giữa services
- ❌ Circular dependencies

